  "description": "NEW TO THE MARKET\n\nPrime Residential Building Site\nSubject to Planning Permission\n\nNigel Dineen & Martin Finn Auctioneers are delighted to present this prime residential site located on the Kiltimagh Road from Knock, Co. Mayo.\n\nThis attractive site is situated within walking distance of Knock Shrine and all local amenities and services, offering an excellent opportunity to construct a family home in a highly sought-after location.\n\nThe site comprises dry, solid ground and has been developed and prepared, making it an ideal proposition for a purchaser seeking a ready-to-go site, subject to obtaining planning permission.\n\nFeatures:\n\n• Prime residential site in a sought-after location\n• Walking distance to Knock Shrine and village amenities\n• Dry, solid building ground\n• Public water available\n• Public sewage available\n• Broadband and electricity passing by the property\n• Excellent accessibility to Knock Airport, Claremorris and Ballyhaunis\n• Ready for development subject to planning permission\n\nLocation Highlights:\n\n• Walking distance to Knock Shrine\n• Minutes from Knock Village\n• Approx. 10 minutes to Ireland West Airport Knock\n• Easy access to Claremorris, Ballyhaunis and Kiltimagh\n• Excellent road connectivity via the N17 corridor\n\nViewing comes highly recommended and is strictly by appointment with the sole selling agents.\n\nNigel Dineen & Martin Finn Auctioneers\nMIPAV MMCEPI\nPSRA Licence No: 002031\n\nOffices Roscommon & Mayo\n\n086 2130723\n094 9362216\n\nEverything we touch turns to SOLD\n\nDisclaimer:\nThese particulars are issued for guidance only and do not form part of any contract. Intending purchasers should satisfy themselves as to the accuracy of all details.",
